      "problem": "$(1-2{n}^{2})(1+2{n}^{2})=$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)(a-b)={a}^{2}-{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=1$ and $b=2{n}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(1-2{n}^{2})(1+2{n}^{2}) & = \\\\ {1}^{2}-{(2{n}^{2})}^{2} & = \\\\ 1-4{n}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
